      "content": "wait, you're saying i should take aspirin too? i thought aspirin was an nsaid as well. wouldn't adding aspirin to the ibuprofen while i'm already on eliquis make the bleeding risk even worse? i'm really confused now because i just wanted to know how to stay safe.",
